{"id":"vod_md_3088","vodId":"3088","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"迷糊餐厅第一季","name_cn":"迷糊餐厅第一季","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230823-1/b6d12ecba67024191f9debf319f72f80.jpg"},"summary":"小鸟游是家中独子，上有姐姐下有妹妹，从小生活在女人堆里，酷爱一切和可爱有关的事物。机缘巧合的来到一家叫做瓦古娜利亚的餐厅打工，开始了学校、打工、家事三点一线的忙碌生活。小鸟游渐渐发现，原来瓦古娜利亚餐厅的店员都各具特色：种岛是个外形娇小，长着一张娃娃脸的可爱女生，凭借这令自己相当头疼的卡哇伊外形深得大家疼爱。伊波有着男性恐惧症，对女顾客服务完美的无法挑剔，却因为这奇怪的病症经常殴打男顾客。八千代是外场负责人，特点是喜欢佩戴一把武士道，和爱吃的店长白藤杏子，冷面厨师佐藤三人有着暧昧不清的关系。面对这些怪异却有趣的同事，小鸟游也随着时间渐渐融入到了这别具特色的餐厅打工生活中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-23 08:16:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/1bjSfpSk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/2nB2CJpR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/QFXho6pL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/1xBzyGG4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/bOSJAuSN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/J8hRYobj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/0kH2IOQR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/1gANozFe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/F9eixsxC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/VRi8fQEs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/j03pcuEe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/yMPIMd2g/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/zMz6rBYf/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:20.293Z"}